      "text": "[6:20PM] #Vi #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic in Victoria Island is busy, especially from BJ to Civic Centre, on the ramp bridge to Falomo, and from Akin Adeshola bridge down to Law School and Civic Centre. \nHigh influx at BJ 1004 are slowing movement down.\nOfficers are on ground working to keep traffic moving.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
